stures without parent scrolling. Every final production capture reported 0 compositing layers and 0 pointer hooks.\n\nVisual artifacts: docs/images/markdown-preview-math.png, markdown-preview-mermaid.png, markdown-preview-tasks.png and syntax-textmate.png. Complete local captures are in bin/markdown-preview-snapshots and bin/markdown-regression-snapshots. Logs are bin/markdown-preview-snapshots.log, markdown-regression-*.log, markdown-checks.log and markdown-native-tests.log. Staged code passed whitespace checks; upstream notices retain their original whitespace.\n\nscripts/rayde.sh --native --build and scripts/package-macos.sh passed. The native executable is bin/rayde and the application is bin/RayDE.app. Packaged Markdown manifests, rayscript.hdll and the grammar notices were compared with their source/staged counterparts.\n\nAshui pin 418bc4ac36276ca584c1e2c11c599f40dadf1405 includes CanvasKit scrolled-coordinate/wheel-propagation fixes (4ffe1c24ea0142902d7e0be428870801106703a9) and InlineFlow owner cleanup. The latter is on sibling branch rayde-inline-cleanup, prepared in the existing dependency cache without touching its unfinished working-tree edit. The native library is unchanged and reuses the existing Ashui target; the renderer builds reuse ../rayscript/target. No worktrees or duplicate Cargo targets were added.","files":null}]}